    1
    00:00:05,964 --> 00:00:07,966
    ["Roll With The Changes" plays]
    
    2
    00:00:25,692 --> 00:00:28,195
    ♪ <i>As soon as you are able </i>♪
    
    3
    00:00:28,278 --> 00:00:31,490
    <i>♪ Woman, I am willing ♪</i>
    
    4
    00:00:31,573 --> 00:00:35,661
    <i>♪ To make the break
    That we are on the brink of ♪</i>
    
    5
    00:00:35,744 --> 00:00:38,372
    <i>♪ My cup is on the table ♪</i>
    
    6
    00:00:38,455 --> 00:00:41,124
    <i>♪ My love is spilling ♪</i>
    
    7
    00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:45,963
    <i>♪ Waiting here
    For you to take and drink of ♪</i>
    
    8
    00:00:47,673 --> 00:00:52,553
    <i>♪ So if you're tired
    Of the same old story ♪</i>
    
    9
    00:00:52,636 --> 00:00:56,181
    <i>♪ Oh, turn some pages ♪</i>
    
    10
    00:00:57,766 --> 00:01:01,019
    <i>♪ I'll be here when you are ready ♪</i>
    
    11
    00:01:01,812 --> 00:01:03,814
    <i>♪ To roll with the changes ♪</i>
    
    12
    00:01:04,898 --> 00:01:07,234
    <i>♪ Yeah, yeah ♪</i>
    
    13
    00:01:16,827 --> 00:01:19,079
    <i>♪ I knew it had to happen ♪</i>
    
    14
    00:01:19,162 --> 00:01:22,374
    <i>♪ Felt the tables turning ♪</i>
    
    15
    00:01:23,166 --> 00:01:26,878
    <i>♪ Got me through my darkest hour ♪</i>
    
    16
    00:01:26,962 --> 00:01:29,298
    <i>♪ I heard the thunder clapping ♪</i>
    
    17
    00:01:29,381 --> 00:01:32,551
    <i>♪ Felt the desert burning ♪</i>
    (cut off)

