    1
    00:01:01,812 --> 00:01:04,815
    SKANDAL SENI BELA DIRI!
    DRAMA KARATE DOJO TEMPATAN
    
    2
    00:01:06,233 --> 00:01:07,484
    SELAMAT KEMBALI!
    
    3
    00:01:21,957 --> 00:01:23,959
    SELAMAT DATANG
    PANDUAN PELAJAR BARU
    
    4
    00:02:08,170 --> 00:02:09,379
    - Segar betul.
    - Hei.
    
    5
    00:02:11,131 --> 00:02:12,007
    Hei.
    
    6
    00:02:14,593 --> 00:02:15,636
    Awak dengar tak?
    
    7
    00:02:16,428 --> 00:02:17,429
    Maksud saya…
    
    8
    00:02:18,680 --> 00:02:22,684
    Dengarlah betapa merdunya bunyi
    ketiadaan perang karate.
    
    9
    00:02:24,227 --> 00:02:26,605
    Inilah ganjaran tumpaskan Terry Silver.
    
    10
    00:02:26,688 --> 00:02:29,733
    Ketika saya menang pada 1985,
    aman hidup 30 tahun.
    
    11
    00:02:29,816 --> 00:02:32,069
    Semoga aman 30 tahun lagi.
    
    12
    00:02:33,111 --> 00:02:35,030
    Melainkan dakwaannya digugurkan.
    
    13
    00:02:35,113 --> 00:02:36,948
    Reputasi dia dah hancur.
    
    14
    00:02:37,032 --> 00:02:38,992
    Siapa nak berguru dengannya lagi?
    
    15
    00:02:39,076 --> 00:02:40,661
    Amanda, kita selamat.
    
    16
    00:02:41,161 --> 00:02:41,995
    Yalah.
    
    17
    (cut off)

