    5
    00:00:27,069 --> 00:00:29,571
    <i>♪ Ain't that a kick in the head? ♪</i>
    
    6
    00:00:32,115 --> 00:00:34,576
    <i>♪ The room was completely black ♪</i>
    
    7
    00:00:36,161 --> 00:00:38,163
    <i>♪ I hugged her and she hugged back ♪</i>
    
    8
