    1
    00:01:20,330 --> 00:01:22,082
    KARATE COBRA KAI
    
    2
    00:01:52,112 --> 00:01:54,031
    Jadi, aku dapat piama karate juga, tidak?
    
    3
    00:01:54,114 --> 00:01:55,365
    Diam!
    
    4
    00:01:55,824 --> 00:01:58,118
    Murid hanya bicara saat diajak bicara.
    Paham?
    
    5
    00:01:58,535 --> 00:01:59,536
    Ya.
    
    6
    00:02:02,039 --> 00:02:02,873
    Ya, Pak?
    
    7
    00:02:02,956 --> 00:02:04,958
    Panggil aku sensei. Paham?
    
    8
    00:02:05,417 --> 00:02:06,251
    Ya, Sensei.
    
    9
    00:02:06,335 --> 00:02:07,753
    Bukan piama. Namanya<i> gi.</i>
    
    10
    00:02:07,836 --> 00:02:09,755
    Kau akan dapat jika sudah layak.
    
    11
    00:02:11,256 --> 00:02:12,591
    Siap memulai latihan?
    
    12
    00:02:12,674 --> 00:02:13,675
    Ya, Sensei.
    
    13
    00:02:14,468 --> 00:02:15,344
    Apa…
    
    14
    00:02:15,427 --> 00:02:19,139
    - Aduh.
    - Pelajaran pertama, serang lebih dulu.
    
    15
    00:02:20,057 --> 00:02:21,642
    Jangan tunggu diserang.
    
    16
    00:02:21,725 --> 00:02:23,644
    - Kasih aba-aba kek.
    - Diam!
    
    17
    00:02:24,770 --> 00:02:26,772
    Kita tak berlatih berbelas kasih.
    (cut off)

