    1
    00:01:20,330 --> 00:01:22,207
    KARATE COBRA KAI
    
    2
    00:01:52,195 --> 00:01:54,781
    - Saya akan dapat pijama karate?
    - Senyap!
    
    3
    00:01:55,824 --> 00:01:58,118
    Murid cuma bercakap apabila disuruh.
    
    4
    00:01:58,535 --> 00:01:59,536
    Ya.
    
    5
    00:02:02,039 --> 00:02:02,873
    Ya, tuan?
    
    6
    00:02:02,956 --> 00:02:04,958
    Panggil saya sensei.
    Faham?
    
    7
    00:02:05,042 --> 00:02:06,251
    Ya, sensei.
    
    8
    00:02:06,335 --> 00:02:07,753
    Bukan pijama. Ini <i>gi</i>.
    
    9
    00:02:07,836 --> 00:02:09,755
    Awak akan dapat sesudah layak.
    
    10
    00:02:11,298 --> 00:02:12,591
    Sedia untuk berlatih?
    
    11
    00:02:12,674 --> 00:02:13,675
    Ya, sensei.
    
    12
    00:02:14,468 --> 00:02:15,344
    Apa yang…
    
    13
    00:02:15,427 --> 00:02:19,389
    - Tuhanku.
    - Pelajaran pertama. Serang dulu.
    
    14
    00:02:20,057 --> 00:02:21,725
    Jangan tunggu musuh serang.
    
    15
    00:02:21,808 --> 00:02:23,644
    - Berilah amaran.
    - Senyap!
    
    16
    00:02:24,686 --> 00:02:26,772
    Di sini, tiada simpati.
    
    17
    00:02:27,773 --> 00:02:29,566
    (cut off)

