    1
    00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:06,800
    PREVIOUSLY ON "LOST"...
    
    2
    00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:09,880
    IF WE CAN DO WHAT FARADAY SAID,
    OUR PLANE NEVER CRASHES.
    
    3
    00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:12,320
    COME ON, YOU SON OF A BITCH!
    [buzzing, magnetic humming]
    
    4
    00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:14,800
    [explosion]
    
    5
    00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:23,080
    [grunts] AAH!
    
    6
    00:00:24,160 --> 00:00:26,720
    THAT'S THE SWAN HATCH...
    AFTER DESMOND BLEW IT UP.
    
    7
    00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:28,120
    THEY BUILT IT?
    
    8
    00:00:28,120 --> 00:00:29,640
    [grunts] YOU WERE WRONG!
    
    9
    00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:31,720
    YOU SAID WE COULD STOP IT
    FROM EVER BEING BUILT!
    
    10
    00:00:31,720 --> 00:00:33,520
    THAT OUR PLANE WOULD
    NEVER CRASH ON THIS ISLAND!
    
    11
    00:00:33,520 --> 00:00:34,400
    [Kate] STOP THIS!
    
    12
    00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:36,920
    - I THOUGHT IT WOULD WORK.
    - WELL IT DIDN'T!
    
    13
    00:01:00,040 --> 00:01:01,720
    [Juliet, weakly] HELP.
    
    14
    00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:04,480
    JULIET!
    
    15
    00:01:04,480 --> 00:01:06,280
    [metal clanks]
    JULIET?
    
    16
    00:01:06,280 --> 00:01:08,360
    [whispers] I HAVE
    (cut off)

