    1
    00:00:01,392 --> 00:00:02,872
    BOYD: Previously onFrom.
    [EERIE MUSIC PLAYING]
    
    2
    00:00:02,959 --> 00:00:04,917
    You feel it. You do.
    
    3
    00:00:05,005 --> 00:00:08,443
    When I walked inside the ruins,
    I think I went somewhere.
    
    4
    00:00:09,226 --> 00:00:10,445
    You're a Storywalker.
    
    5
    00:00:10,532 --> 00:00:13,535
    But you can't change a story
    once it's been told.
    
    6
    00:00:14,231 --> 00:00:17,234
    Me and Jade, we try to save
    those children, set them free.
    
    7
    00:00:17,321 --> 00:00:19,541
    We've come back
    over and over again
    
    8
    00:00:19,628 --> 00:00:21,673
    because we failed
    the first time.
    
    9
    00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:23,849
    Knowledge comes with a cost.
    
    10
    00:00:23,980 --> 00:00:25,721
    [GRUNTS]
    
    11
    00:00:26,722 --> 00:00:28,289
    [GASPS, CHOKES]
    
    12
    00:00:29,942 --> 00:00:32,249
    TABITHA:
    Where's your father?
    He's not back yet.
    
    13
    00:00:32,336 --> 00:00:33,990
    Wasn't he with you?
    TABITHA: Yeah.
    
    14
    00:00:34,077 --> 00:00:35,383
    We just got separated.
    
    15
    00:00:35,513 --> 00:00:36,862
    [TIRES SCREECHING]
    
    16
    (cut off)

