    1
    00:00:36,320 --> 00:00:41,280
    The decisive battles of WWII
    are on the Eastern Front.
    
    2
    00:00:41,360 --> 00:00:45,720
    The Allies must get weapons and supplies
    to the Soviet Union.
    
    3
    00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:52,880
    This cargo is sent with freighters
    that sail in formations, convoys.
    
    4
    00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:56,240
    The crews are civilian seamen.
    
    5
    00:00:58,400 --> 00:01:02,280
    The Allies protect the convoys
    with a military escort.
    
    6
    00:01:02,360 --> 00:01:06,480
    German planes, warships and U-boats
    are a constant threat.
    
    7
    00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:11,720
    Summer 1942
    
    8
    00:01:11,800 --> 00:01:15,280
    Convoy route: Iceland - Murmansk
    
    9
    00:01:15,360 --> 00:01:18,640
    Estimated crossing time: 12 days
    
    10
    00:01:29,280 --> 00:01:33,880
    DAY 4
    
    11
    00:01:41,440 --> 00:01:43,440
    -Ready the lifeboat!
    -Leave that.
    
    12
    00:01:44,280 --> 00:01:45,320
    We haven't been hit yet.
    
    13
    00:01:57,920 --> 00:01:59,520
    The bridge is mine.
    
    14
    00:01:59,800 --> 00:02:02,360
    Lamp signal from no. 11.
    U-boat observed.
    
    15
    00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:03,560
    And more from 21.
    
    16
    00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:12,280
    Any updates?
    (cut off)

